ems-center justify-center font-normal leading-brand tracking-normal transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-charcoal text-beige! hover:underline rounded-lg px-8 py-4 text-lg  w-full text-xl lowercase rounded-none" href="https://dashboard.onkernel.com/sign-up">get free</a><ul class="text-xl font-light leading-brand tracking-(--letter-spacing-headline) lowercase text-charcoal list-disc list-inside space-y-1"><li>$5 / month free credits</li><li>5 concurrent browsers</li><li>live view</li><li>stealth mode (captcha solver &amp; proxy)</li><li>managed auth (3 connections)</li><li>session replays (1 day)</li><li>file uploads &amp; downloads</li><li>vaults &amp; payments (3 vaults)</li></ul></div><div class="border-[0.5px] border-charcoal p-8 flex flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lowercase text-charcoal"><p class="text-xl font-normal leading-brand tracking-body">hobbyist</p><p class="text-[40px] font-light leading-brand tracking-headline">$30/mo.</p><p class="text-base font-normal leading-brand">plus usage costs*</p></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-normal leading-brand tracking-normal transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-charcoal text-beige! hover:underline rounded-lg px-8 py-4 text-lg  w-full text-xl lowercase rounded-none" href="https://dashboard.onkernel.com/billing/plans/confirm?plan=hobbyist">get hobbyist</a><ul class="text-xl font-light leading-brand tracking-(--letter-spacing-headline) lowercase text-charcoal list-disc list-inside space-y-1"><li>all the features in free, plus:</li><li>$10 / month free credits</li><li>10 concurrent browsers</li><li>unlimited proxy usage</li><li>session replays (7 days)</li><li>unlimited managed auth connections</li><li>unlimited vaults &amp; payments</li></ul></div><div class="border-[0.5px] border-charcoal p-8 flex flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex